OL,3,GNEWSAAir pollution rises inside city's
OL,4,Aclean air zone
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn increase in air pollution inside a
OL,7,Fclean air zone (CAZ) is down to the
OL,8,Fimpact of weather, a local council has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FNew data has revealed that nitrogen
OL,12,Fdioxide levels rose on average by 2.4%
OL,13,Finside Bristol's CAZ in 2025 compared
OL,14,Fto the previous year.
OL,16,FBristol City Council said the recent
OL,17,Fincrease was down to weather factors,
OL,18,Fwhich was mirrored in other parts of
OL,19,Fthe country.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
