OL,3,GNEWSAAir pollution rises inside city's
OL,4,Aclean air zone
OL,5,
OL,6,FPollution levels have still fallen by
OL,7,F16% since charges on non-compliant
OL,8,Fvehicles were introduced in 2022, which
OL,9,Fthe local authority said was "the most
OL,10,Fimportant measure of progress".
